How many infants does your study need? Ground your planning in everything the literature already knows: pick a phenomenon, optionally condition on age and method variables, and get the meta-analytically estimated effect size with the sample size needed to detect it at 80% power (α = .05, two-sided, within-subjects normal approximation).


